  "rationale": "After review of pcu_core.v, the design is otherwise clean, but the debug_enable-gated mux path that exposes watchdog_cnt on debug_out via debug_sel selection is flagged as suspicious out of caution, since debug_sel is externally controllable and could theoretically be used to exfiltrate internal counter state. The watchdog counter itself only affects status[15] and has no other side effects."
